kernora-archive (1.2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Demo updates: an opt-in second channel, ember-demo, that gets new
    Kernora packages before everyone else. Settings > System turns it on
    and off through /usr/libexec/kernora-update-channel; turning it off
    keeps the demo versions until a normal update replaces them.

